635
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,740
No trouble for over 500 years.

636
00:36:05,030 --> 00:36:06,300
Isn't it all the same where I am?

637
00:36:09,110 --> 00:36:09,900
Yes.

638
00:36:10,720 --> 00:36:11,610
It's been 500 years.

639
00:36:12,990 --> 00:36:13,860
Over these 500 years,

640
00:36:14,670 --> 00:36:16,090
don't you feel we forgot something?

641
00:36:18,440 --> 00:36:19,220
For instance,

642
00:36:20,760 --> 00:36:22,420
how did we first meet?

643
00:36:23,070 --> 00:36:23,860
For instance,

644
00:36:25,470 --> 00:36:27,090
why are we dressed like this?

645
00:36:27,670 --> 00:36:28,450
And also,

646
00:36:29,510 --> 00:36:30,450
do you not feel

647
00:36:32,150 --> 00:36:33,740
someone is missing on Bear Island?

648
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,260
I seem

649
00:36:38,400 --> 00:36:39,940
to have the same feeling.

650
00:36:46,070 --> 00:36:47,900
We have lived for ages.

651
00:36:47,920 --> 00:36:48,940
Forgetting a few things

652
00:36:48,990 --> 00:36:49,860
is only natural.

653
00:36:50,510 --> 00:36:51,380
I researched it.

654
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:53,450
Our emotions

655
00:36:53,470 --> 00:36:55,780
have a defense mechanism.

656
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:58,130
Things we don't wanna recall

657
00:36:58,240 --> 00:36:59,450
get automatically forgotten.

658
00:37:46,320 --> 00:37:47,530
The sword is

659
00:37:47,960 --> 00:37:49,260
where the heart is.

660
00:37:50,070 --> 00:37:51,050
Who was it

661
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:54,010
that told me this?

662
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:15,490
Smells familiar.

663
00:38:15,490 --> 00:38:20,500
[Hall of United Spirits]

664
00:38:25,720 --> 00:38:26,490
Mentor.

665
00:38:28,110 --> 00:38:28,900
Mentor.

666
00:38:29,070 --> 00:38:29,860
Mentor.

